  "description": "Welcoming the 2023 For Life V4 STAY STRONG frame. Building on the previous race winning frame but now with all new chrome decals. The V4 is still available in disc only* or regular v-brake options. Transferring the stiffness of the V1, the oversized tubing of the V2 and the World Cup main making geometry of the V3. The V4 is our fastest frame ever! The frame features triple butted down & toptube, double butted chain & seat stays adding strength while saving weight. We have once again increased the frames stiffness for power transfer and speed. The smooth welds also help give the all new chrome effect water decals and graphics a fresh clean look. The Expert sized frames feature a 1-1/8th head tube, Euro bottom bracket and 10mm rear dropouts (10mm enclosed dropouts on disc frames). The Expert frame uses a 22.2mm seat post** which reduces weight. All Pro sized frames have a tapered headtube (1-⅛” - 1.5”) and BB86 bottom bracket shells. The Pro frame uses a 31.6mm seat post** which helps improve stiffness. *Disc only frames have a 10mm disc hanger included. (15mm and 20mm disc hangers available to purchase). **This frame in Expert sizes & Cruiser Expert XL require a 22.2mm Seatpost & 24.4mm Seatpost clamp, all remaining sizes use a 31.6mm post & 34.9mm clamp. ###section### Product Specs",
